  "title": "1942 Map of Hyderabad City",
  "description": "'Map of Hyderabad City', dated 1-6-1351 F. (5-3-1942), published by the Municipal Publicity Department, Hyderabad. A pictorial map of roads, lakes and 28 numbered landmarks; the landmarks are the layer '1942 City Map Landmarks'. From a photograph of a framed print, cropped to the map. Not to scale: fitted to 12 landmarks, lakes and the Musi and bent between them, so positions are approximate.",
